{"title":"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The expression\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/7/b57109c95c86c11d20d59d6813fcf623a616b884.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{P+Q}{P-Q}-\\frac{P-Q}{P+Q}\\]\" width=\"128\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/e/7aedf861827009c2c64c27e579d96be675f2a065.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P=x+y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"80\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/3/8532160d5dc8f00c1b867966aca336e8755a83d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q=x-y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"80\" height=\"16\" />, is equivalent to:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4c83f2a2e764b74963554ac800b600b4f9f560.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{x^2-y^2}{xy}\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{x^2-y^2}{2xy}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{x^2+y^2}{xy}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{x^2+y^2}{2xy}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"555\" height=\"42\" /> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/2/7c2ce18e7866bc9f7f934b08a380238f6c55189d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P+Q = 2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"94\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/f/dff9b0a6932d413f0e4d3a33c2a345cfdcd6b306.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P - Q = 2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" />, it follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/7/1a7765863ba6f58ffd9d778e91d4eb0529de8739.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{P+Q}{P-Q}-\\frac{P-Q}{P+Q} = \\frac{2x}{2y} - \\frac{2y}{2x} = \\frac{x}{y} - \\frac{y}{x} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{x^2 - y^2}{xy}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"434\" height=\"55\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/6/b86796388d495a3e35acd6a5a53cdd028039154f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{P+Q}{P-Q} - \\frac{P-Q}{P+Q} = \\frac{(P+Q)^2 - (P - Q)^2}{(P-Q)(P+Q)} = \\frac{(2P)(2Q)}{(P-Q)(P+Q)} = \\frac{4PQ}{(P-Q)(P+Q)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"645\" height=\"45\" />.\n</p><p>Substituting for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/e/9ae2a23d3d3007547dcb5e263d9a8bc2f6630c1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4(x^2 - y^2)}{(2y)(2x)}=\\frac{4(x^2 - y^2)}{4xy} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)} \\frac{x^2 - y^2}{xy}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"321\" height=\"55\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If it's true for all values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, then it's true for a specific value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />.  Letting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/c/51c80ea5862b45877f08d698a0c893bd2806a2fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/a/61a79da7e7844d252be666cb25e2ed8a2c9a96e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/b/05b880c2aee09a9dc87bbc26de5614df2f5d8f59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P = 9$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/7/5f7e7694697f701a618a6581264c27d61495bd14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"46\" height=\"16\" />.  The fraction becomes:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/1/ae1cad15cbd204ee33d9dd992d86da850bc9887f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9 + 1}{9 - 1} - \\frac{9 - 1}{9 + 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"113\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/4/93470bcdf9afa1d4a8a2e2369afa39aa115f0b51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10}{8} - \\frac{8}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"65\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/d/03d46c17995c215c4001f7f2e577d7846096f4aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{4} - \\frac{4}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"47\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/e/77e9546054205b85a74a69c008c0731e4363d4d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{25}{20} - \\frac{16}{20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"65\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/b/2bb2a4624c9d56c651bd76aa7359c2d4cb653bb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/7/a573b3ce7c7a302fb4e2dc6dfcc7dd0fb29514c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y) = (5, 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"109\" height=\"20\" /> into the answer choices gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/b/7fb0bd99d7ef29fa8b92bfc5dffaae632d1b4b89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{20}, \\frac{9}{40}, 1, \\frac{41}{20}, \\frac{41}{40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"128\" height=\"38\" />.  Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME\" title=\"1964 AHSME\">1964 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1964 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1964\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b